- `.github/workflows/` - New CI workflow file
- `README.md` - Documentation updates

**Regression Tests Required:**
- [ ] npm scripts execute successfully
  - **Verification:** `npm run validate:vfs && npm run test:categories`
  - **Expected:** Exit code 0, all tests pass
- [ ] CI workflow file is valid YAML
  - **Verification:** Manual review + test run

**Out of Scope:**
- Deploying to production CI/CD (document only)
- Setting up external monitoring services
- Alerting/notification systems

