## 🚨 Risk Mitigation

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|--------|------------|
| Sanity API unavailable | Low | High | Add retry logic, graceful degradation |
| Data inconsistencies found | Medium | Medium | Document only, defer fixes to new sprint |
| Test execution slow | Medium | Medium | Add timeouts, parallel execution |
| Environment variable issues | Medium | High | Clear error messages, setup documentation |
| Existing test conflicts | Low | Medium | Isolated test directory, Phase 0 verification |

